WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:57.835
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:58.105 --> 02:03.021
DELUSION

3
02:12.771 --> 02:14.938
How did this catch fire?

4
02:16.813 --> 02:22.313
This isn't the time of year when things catch fire.

5
02:22.396 --> 02:25.105
I think it's more likely to be arson.

6
02:25.938 --> 02:28.313
Look, the ground is still wet.

7
02:37.896 --> 02:40.646
Inspector, could you please come over here?

8
02:40.730 --> 02:42.271
This way, Inspector.

9
03:00.480 --> 03:02.605
The victim's teeth were missing too.

10
03:02.688 --> 03:05.271
Before I came to work here,

11
03:05.355 --> 03:09.188
I'd also come across cases in other places where the victims' teeth were missing.

12
03:10.105 --> 03:14.063
A body was found beneath a tree wrapped in a three-colored cloth.

13
03:14.146 --> 03:15.980
-Forensics. Copy, over. -Copy.

14
03:39.813 --> 03:42.146
-What's up, Wan? -Wat.

15
03:46.146 --> 03:48.188
Dad and I are on our way.

16
03:48.271 --> 03:50.646
Can Dad stay at your place?

17
03:52.021 --> 03:53.646
Hang on. What's going on?

18
03:55.146 --> 03:57.355
I can't leave Dad alone with Mom anymore.

19
03:57.438 --> 04:00.771
Hey, calm down. What happened?

20
04:02.396 --> 04:04.396
I think Mom killed Uncle Sak.

21
04:14.855 --> 04:17.938
Your patient's here for a follow-up. Should I bring them in?

22
04:18.771 --> 04:20.396
Sure, just give me a moment.

23
04:20.480 --> 04:21.396
Okay.

24
04:23.396 --> 04:24.896
Wan, calm down first.

25
04:24.980 --> 04:27.730
And don't take Dad too far away just yet.

26
04:27.813 --> 04:31.313
He might get confused and you won't be able to handle him.

27
04:31.396 --> 04:34.896
Let's find somewhere nearby for now.

28
04:34.980 --> 04:38.021
I'll head over as soon as I can, okay?

29
04:38.105 --> 04:39.313
Just stay calm. Stay calm.

30
04:39.396 --> 04:41.480
I'll wait at the house by the dam.

31
04:42.480 --> 04:43.480
Come quickly, Wat.

32
05:12.146 --> 05:13.730
What brings you all here this time?

33
05:15.771 --> 05:18.521
There was a fire near your house and you didn't know about it?

34
05:20.438 --> 05:21.438
Where?

35
05:22.271 --> 05:24.563
If I knew, I'd have gone to put it out.

36
05:26.355 --> 05:27.688
Listen to me.

37
05:27.771 --> 05:30.438
We found a body buried on your land.

38
05:30.521 --> 05:33.105
You can't say you don't know anymore.

39
05:33.188 --> 05:34.396
What body?

40
05:37.980 --> 05:38.980
Okay.

41
05:39.896 --> 05:43.563
The burned-down shack and the body we found

42
05:43.646 --> 05:45.771
are both on your property.

43
05:45.855 --> 05:49.230
Everyone in your family is a suspect. You all must go to the police station.

44
05:49.313 --> 05:51.146
Where are Narong and your children?

45
05:54.855 --> 05:55.855
I don't know.

46
05:56.813 --> 05:58.188
They've all abandoned me.

47
06:05.938 --> 06:06.980
Let's go, Nee.

48
06:45.105 --> 06:48.605
INSPECTOR SASIDIT

49
06:48.688 --> 06:49.688
CALL ENDED

50
08:42.438 --> 08:44.896
Someone died on your property.

51
08:44.980 --> 08:46.896
How could you not know anything?

52
08:50.896 --> 08:52.188
It's a big piece of land.

53
08:53.855 --> 08:54.980
How would I know

54
08:56.063 --> 08:57.855
if someone wandered in and died,

55
08:58.688 --> 08:59.980
or was murdered there?

56
09:02.438 --> 09:04.855
No one goes in there anymore.

57
09:04.938 --> 09:06.730
And this box of teeth?

58
09:07.688 --> 09:09.396
How did it end up there?

59
09:13.938 --> 09:17.355
These are all the cases from the past 20 years that I believe are connected.

60
09:18.313 --> 09:19.771
During the first ten years,

61
09:20.480 --> 09:23.230
all the victims were found in Chiang Khan and its surrounding areas.

62
09:23.313 --> 09:25.146
MYSTERIOUS SKELETON DISCOVERED

63
09:25.230 --> 09:26.730
Over the next ten years,

64
09:27.396 --> 09:31.021
bodies with missing teeth were found across different provinces…

65
09:31.105 --> 09:32.730
POLICE TO SOLVE MISSING PERSONS CASES

66
09:32.813 --> 09:34.313
…before Mued's and Sak's murder.

67
09:35.146 --> 09:38.980
But the suspects never had any record of moving anywhere.

68
09:40.146 --> 09:41.938
Are these cases really connected?

69
09:42.688 --> 09:45.021
I'm convinced the killers we still haven't caught

70
09:46.646 --> 09:48.355
are the same person.

71
09:49.480 --> 09:52.646
If you need any warrants, let me know right away.

72
09:53.605 --> 09:54.730
Wrap this up quickly.

73
09:55.605 --> 09:58.646
The news has already spread everywhere.

74
10:33.730 --> 10:36.688
It's Mom's car. Did you arrange for Mom to meet me?

75
10:40.188 --> 10:41.063
Aim!

76
10:42.855 --> 10:43.688
Wait.

77
10:45.313 --> 10:46.771
Let me talk to her first.

78
10:48.271 --> 10:50.146
Then I'll bring her out to see you.

79
10:50.230 --> 10:51.396
I miss Mom.

80
10:52.355 --> 10:53.230
Listen to me!

81
10:56.813 --> 10:58.938
Wait here until I come back. Do you understand?

82
11:02.563 --> 11:03.896
If you don't listen to me…

83
11:06.021 --> 11:07.480
you'll never see her again.

84
12:00.105 --> 12:00.980
What?

85
12:02.480 --> 12:03.896
What is it?

86
12:04.646 --> 12:05.646
What are you doing?

87
12:27.980 --> 12:29.230
Why are you such a bitch?

88
12:31.021 --> 12:31.855
Am I?

89
12:34.396 --> 12:36.021
Everything your family has…

90
12:36.105 --> 12:38.355
didn't my family's name help make it possible?

91
12:39.813 --> 12:41.230
If it weren't for my father,

92
12:42.355 --> 12:44.271
would your family have gotten prime properties

93
12:44.355 --> 12:46.646
to profit off the villagers?

94
12:55.813 --> 12:58.230
Your family's old name…

95
13:00.021 --> 13:01.646
isn't worth shit.

96
13:06.063 --> 13:07.146
You people…

97
13:08.730 --> 13:11.063
You married me because you were after my money.

98
13:12.896 --> 13:15.021
You're a gold digger. You lowlife!

99
13:30.313 --> 13:32.230
You had sex with her right here.

100
13:33.313 --> 13:34.188
You disgust me.

101
13:35.313 --> 13:36.438
Why?

102
13:44.355 --> 13:45.938
You're going to leak the video?

103
13:48.271 --> 13:49.730
You're going to ruin me, huh?

104
13:52.605 --> 13:54.105
Didn't you say you loved our son?

105
13:55.646 --> 13:58.813
Didn't you say you loved Aim? Aren't you afraid he'll be ashamed?

106
14:01.646 --> 14:03.605
I won't do the awful things you think I will.

107
14:06.105 --> 14:07.396
But you're right.

108
14:08.730 --> 14:11.521
I married you because I wanted your money.

109
14:13.105 --> 14:14.730
But you didn't give it to me for free.

110
14:16.313 --> 14:17.771
I got in exchange for my life,

111
14:19.021 --> 14:21.021
my dignity, everything.

112
14:22.605 --> 14:23.980
It's your turn to lose something.

113
14:27.480 --> 14:28.605
I'll divorce you.

114
14:29.813 --> 14:31.355
But Aim stays with me.

115
14:33.730 --> 14:35.271
You and your mother,

116
14:35.355 --> 14:37.730
neither of you knows how to raise a decent person.

117
14:38.521 --> 14:39.646
It's obvious.

118
14:53.813 --> 14:55.396
Gold digger!

119
15:45.646 --> 15:46.771
Dad!

120
15:46.855 --> 15:47.938
Dad.

121
16:58.688 --> 16:59.646
Aim!

122
17:02.480 --> 17:03.855
Pannee.

123
17:03.938 --> 17:07.105
If I find out later that you knew, you'll be charged as an accomplice.

124
17:07.605 --> 17:08.938
That's a long prison sentence.

125
17:23.271 --> 17:24.521
WANRUDEE

126
17:25.855 --> 17:26.688
Hello?

127
17:26.771 --> 17:28.688
Please help me.

128
17:28.771 --> 17:30.480
My father took my son again.

129
17:31.021 --> 17:32.855
Calm down. Where are you right now?

130
17:32.938 --> 17:34.438
Aim.

131
17:36.396 --> 17:37.355
Aim.

132
17:47.438 --> 17:48.313
Aim.

133
17:54.230 --> 17:55.146
Aim.

134
17:57.438 --> 17:58.396
Aim.

135
18:06.813 --> 18:07.688
Aim.

136
18:28.188 --> 18:29.021
Dad.

137
18:31.271 --> 18:32.146
Come out.

138
18:33.938 --> 18:34.896
I won't hurt you.

139
18:42.938 --> 18:43.938
Dad.

140
19:36.230 --> 19:37.438
Search everywhere.

141
19:38.063 --> 19:39.563
The suspect can't have gone far.

142
20:39.355 --> 20:40.896
Hey, sit down. Sit!

143
20:42.646 --> 20:43.730
Go sit down.

144
20:46.063 --> 20:46.980
He's still asleep.

145
20:51.355 --> 20:52.396
I said go and sit down.

146
21:15.896 --> 21:17.605
Mom didn't kill Uncle Sak.

147
21:19.271 --> 21:20.230
She almost did.

148
21:22.105 --> 21:23.188
But she didn't do it.

149
21:33.188 --> 21:34.021
Nee.

150
21:34.771 --> 21:35.688
Help…

151
21:36.521 --> 21:38.480
Help me.

152
22:09.730 --> 22:11.688
Are you a ghost trying to eat that dead rat?

153
22:14.855 --> 22:15.855
I'm not a ghost.

154
22:15.938 --> 22:16.771
I didn't eat it.

155
22:16.855 --> 22:18.605
Then why were you poking it with a stick?

156
22:18.688 --> 22:20.396
You're a ghost. You just don't know it.

157
22:20.480 --> 22:22.313
I'm not. I didn't eat it.

158
22:23.771 --> 22:24.646
Eat it.

159
22:26.271 --> 22:28.313
Eat it, you ghost.

160
22:29.730 --> 22:30.938
Eat!

161
22:36.438 --> 22:37.480
Eat it.

162
23:31.355 --> 23:33.146
Let me go!

163
23:33.230 --> 23:35.271
Let me go! I'm not a ghost!

164
23:35.355 --> 23:37.188
Let me go!

165
25:39.188 --> 25:41.646
You look so much like Dad when you make that face.

166
25:44.730 --> 25:45.563
Why?

167
25:49.105 --> 25:50.230
Do I disgust you?

168
25:58.730 --> 25:59.688
I get it, though.

169
26:02.146 --> 26:03.938
I never wanted to be like this.

170
26:05.105 --> 26:06.771
But once I started,

171
26:07.813 --> 26:09.688
I just couldn't stop.

172
26:10.813 --> 26:12.396
It feels so good

173
26:12.480 --> 26:13.813
getting rid of scum.

174
26:13.896 --> 26:14.813
Shit.

175
26:18.355 --> 26:19.771
It feels like I'm getting revenge

176
26:20.355 --> 26:21.480
on that piece of shit.

177
26:24.063 --> 26:25.396
I get to decide

178
26:25.480 --> 26:27.146
who lives

179
26:27.980 --> 26:29.105
and who dies.

180
26:36.271 --> 26:38.021
Why would he keep this?

181
26:47.230 --> 26:49.188
He didn't mean to. You know that.

182
26:51.146 --> 26:53.855
But Uncle Sak was smart.

183
26:54.605 --> 26:56.063
When he found out I'd killed again,

184
26:56.146 --> 26:59.480
he used my victims' bodies to spin a story and tell the villagers

185
26:59.563 --> 27:01.105
they were killed by Phii Pong.

186
27:01.646 --> 27:04.605
He set himself up as a shaman and made a living off the villagers.

187
27:06.605 --> 27:07.646
Terrible, isn't it?

188
27:19.438 --> 27:21.230
So Mom and Dad sent me to Bangkok,

189
27:22.188 --> 27:24.271
hoping the city would cure me.

190
27:50.021 --> 27:50.855
But me?

191
27:51.813 --> 27:52.938
I never intended to stop.

192
27:56.730 --> 27:57.646
Hello.

193
27:57.730 --> 28:00.980
REGISTRATION

194
28:02.313 --> 28:03.563
After becoming a doctor,

195
28:04.521 --> 28:08.313
it became even easier to find these scumbags.

196
28:13.896 --> 28:15.063
Are you here alone?

197
28:15.146 --> 28:16.021
Yes.

198
28:17.313 --> 28:18.813
MOBILE MEDICAL VOLUNTEER UNIT

199
28:18.896 --> 28:20.355
I get to decide

200
28:20.438 --> 28:21.980
who gets to live

201
28:22.563 --> 28:23.896
and who doesn't.

202
28:30.730 --> 28:31.688
These scumbags,

203
28:32.355 --> 28:34.063
they're all the same

204
28:34.855 --> 28:36.730
with different faces.

205
29:02.730 --> 29:03.813
Every tooth I took

206
29:04.521 --> 29:06.313
from their bodies

207
29:08.063 --> 29:11.271
was a reward I gave myself.

208
30:20.563 --> 30:22.021
And actually,

209
30:22.105 --> 30:24.605
did you know they weren't planning to send just me to Bangkok?

210
30:26.146 --> 30:27.355
You were supposed to go.

211
30:30.896 --> 30:31.813
But Uncle Sak…

212
30:33.521 --> 30:35.146
He used what I'd done to blackmail us.

213
30:36.896 --> 30:40.230
Dad ended up giving him all his money and land.

214
30:42.313 --> 30:43.313
But it was never enough,

215
30:43.396 --> 30:45.021
until he killed that kid named Mued.

216
30:46.980 --> 30:50.146
Then he used the teeth to extort money from our family.

217
30:55.230 --> 30:56.313
But I got revenge for you.

218
30:58.480 --> 31:01.855
-Aren't you going to thank me? -Whatever you do is your business.

219
31:04.188 --> 31:05.980
But what do you get by doing this?

220
31:09.521 --> 31:10.355
Well…

221
31:12.563 --> 31:14.021
Mom was never going to say anything.

222
31:15.980 --> 31:17.063
As for Dad,

223
31:17.730 --> 31:19.938
he got one last chance to protect the family.

224
31:24.021 --> 31:24.938
Now it's your turn.

225
31:32.355 --> 31:33.605
I won't go to the police.

226
31:37.105 --> 31:40.396
I won't say anything. I won't tell anyone.

227
31:40.480 --> 31:41.355
I promise.

228
31:42.271 --> 31:43.646
I promise. I really do, Wat.

229
31:44.230 --> 31:46.438
That's what everyone who's about to die says.

230
31:47.063 --> 31:48.146
How can I believe you?

231
32:01.105 --> 32:02.980
Narong, where's your grandson?

232
32:04.646 --> 32:06.021
Hey, sir.

233
32:06.105 --> 32:07.855
-Get him. -Where are you going?

234
32:07.938 --> 32:09.313
-Sir. -Get him.

235
32:10.105 --> 32:11.563
What the fuck are you doing?

236
32:13.480 --> 32:14.480
Take him.

237
32:17.688 --> 32:18.563
Yes, Inspector.

238
32:19.688 --> 32:20.605
Did you find the kid?

239
32:20.688 --> 32:22.355
No sign of the kid, Inspector.

240
32:29.313 --> 32:30.563
Do you have a death wish?

241
32:31.313 --> 32:32.855
If you want to shoot, then shoot!

242
32:35.480 --> 32:36.980
Has anyone called for a boat yet?

243
32:37.063 --> 32:38.563
It's on the way, Inspector.

244
32:39.188 --> 32:40.480
You want to shoot me?

245
32:40.563 --> 32:41.771
Then do it.

246
32:41.855 --> 32:42.813
Do it!

247
32:44.771 --> 32:46.771
I'm not afraid to die. Shoot me!

248
32:46.855 --> 32:47.771
Shoot!

249
33:13.105 --> 33:14.771
Rescue Unit. Copy, over.

250
33:20.271 --> 33:21.605
Keep coming.

251
33:23.980 --> 33:24.980
Keep coming.

252
33:27.896 --> 33:30.605
CHIANG KHAN RESCUE UNIT

253
34:01.021 --> 34:01.855
Aim.

254
34:02.480 --> 34:03.355
Aim.

255
34:05.021 --> 34:07.313
Mrs. Wan, please stay calm.

256
34:07.396 --> 34:08.271
Please stay calm.

257
34:08.355 --> 34:10.230
-Where's my son? -Calm down.

258
34:10.855 --> 34:12.438
Your son is safe.

259
34:13.021 --> 34:15.980
A nurse will bring him here. Don't worry.

260
34:29.730 --> 34:32.688
Do you remember how you ended up on the boat?

261
34:41.021 --> 34:42.230
I blacked out.

262
34:43.521 --> 34:45.105
I can't remember anything.

263
34:48.105 --> 34:51.271
We found midazolam in your and your son's blood.

264
34:52.355 --> 34:53.646
It's a sedative

265
34:54.188 --> 34:56.688
that also causes temporary memory loss after it's administered.

266
34:56.771 --> 34:59.771
So it's normal that you're still groggy and disoriented.

267
35:01.563 --> 35:04.688
But do you really not remember who got to you

268
35:05.396 --> 35:07.438
before you blacked out?

269
35:31.688 --> 35:33.480
Mom did everything she could to protect me.

270
35:35.396 --> 35:36.396
Just like you,

271
35:37.396 --> 35:38.938
who'd do anything to protect Aim.

272
35:43.063 --> 35:44.980
If only you'd cared enough to help me that day,

273
35:45.938 --> 35:47.230
maybe I wouldn't be like this.

274
35:49.105 --> 35:49.938
Don't you think?

275
35:51.980 --> 35:53.480
Help me, Wan!

276
35:53.563 --> 35:55.063
Help me.

277
35:55.146 --> 35:56.313
Help me, Wan!

278
35:56.396 --> 35:57.355
Wan!

279
35:57.438 --> 35:58.730
I said eat it!

280
35:58.813 --> 36:00.480
Wan.

281
36:00.563 --> 36:02.146
Help me, Wan!

282
36:02.771 --> 36:04.230
Wan!

283
36:10.105 --> 36:12.105
But forget it. That was a long time ago.

284
36:15.355 --> 36:16.480
So, for now…

285
36:18.355 --> 36:20.855
just be my big sister for once.

286
36:32.480 --> 36:33.480
Stay still.

287
37:02.146 --> 37:03.313
I didn't see anything.

288
37:08.646 --> 37:09.813
Okay.

289
37:14.938 --> 37:16.313
INVESTIGATION DIVISION

290
37:18.146 --> 37:19.646
You killed your son-in-law, right?

291
37:32.688 --> 37:34.646
Why did you do it, sir?

292
37:41.563 --> 37:43.021
He was beating my daughter.

293
37:43.688 --> 37:45.105
I had to protect her.

294
37:51.313 --> 37:52.938
What about the Phii Pong case?

295
37:54.438 --> 37:56.146
Were you behind that too, sir?

296
38:08.605 --> 38:10.188
Excuse me, sir.

297
38:10.271 --> 38:12.271
Sir, what's the situation right now?

298
38:13.521 --> 38:16.896
We're currently mobilizing all nearby units

299
38:16.980 --> 38:19.813
to help track down clues to find this killer.

300
38:20.855 --> 38:22.188
But I have to admit,

301
38:22.271 --> 38:26.230
a serial killer case like this is something new for our country.

302
38:26.313 --> 38:28.771
I'd like to assure everyone

303
38:28.855 --> 38:31.355
that we're all doing everything we can.

304
38:31.980 --> 38:34.063
Do you have any suspects at this point?

305
38:34.146 --> 38:35.730
-Do you? -Do you?

306
38:35.813 --> 38:37.521
-Please tell us. -Any suspects?

307
38:38.188 --> 38:40.271
How's the kid?

308
38:40.355 --> 38:43.146
He's still unconscious. We don't know his condition.

309
38:48.813 --> 38:51.396
CHIANG KHAN RESCUE UNIT

310
38:53.480 --> 38:54.563
Inspector.

311
38:54.646 --> 38:55.813
I checked it.

312
38:56.771 --> 38:58.271
Every province where Wat has lived

313
38:58.355 --> 39:00.146
matches the crime scenes.

314
39:02.063 --> 39:05.605
If not the police, then it was one of the local shamans.

315
39:06.230 --> 39:08.230
They kept repeating that for over ten years,

316
39:08.313 --> 39:12.230
until no one cared about finding my son's killer.

317
39:12.313 --> 39:14.063
What did you know about it back then?

318
39:14.771 --> 39:16.063
I didn't pay attention.

319
39:16.146 --> 39:21.063
You're ganging up on me to take my land and give it to him, aren't you?

320
39:21.146 --> 39:23.688
If a ghost wants us dead,

321
39:24.438 --> 39:25.980
it doesn't matter how it kills us.

322
39:26.063 --> 39:28.146
Dead is dead, Inspector.

323
39:31.938 --> 39:33.605
You're not lying to me, are you?

324
39:34.188 --> 39:36.105
If you are, I can't help your husband.

325
39:36.188 --> 39:38.730
If you think my husband did it, then go arrest him.

326
39:38.813 --> 39:40.188
Mom.

327
39:55.896 --> 39:57.730
Do you have any suspects at this point?

328
39:59.938 --> 40:01.605
-Do you? -Do you?

329
40:01.688 --> 40:04.021
-Please tell us. -Any suspects?

330
40:04.105 --> 40:05.521
Yes.

331
40:06.313 --> 40:08.480
But we must wait for our forensic team to do their job,

332
40:08.563 --> 40:11.396
because many of these cases happened a long time ago.

333
40:11.480 --> 40:14.188
Can you at least tell us whether the suspect is from this area?

334
40:16.938 --> 40:18.521
Is the suspect a local?

335
40:18.605 --> 40:20.063
It's still too early to say.

336
40:22.855 --> 40:25.105
In that case, let me reiterate our stance.

337
40:25.188 --> 40:27.855
Please rest assured

338
40:27.938 --> 40:30.230
that every officer is working as hard as they can.

339
40:30.313 --> 40:31.271
If you'll excuse me.

340
40:32.688 --> 40:35.313
-Sir. -Please answer.

341
40:35.396 --> 40:37.480
How can we rest assured, sir?

342
40:37.563 --> 40:39.355
Tell us whether the suspect is a local.

343
40:39.438 --> 40:41.646
Sir, just one more question, please!

344
40:46.521 --> 40:47.730
CHIANG KHAN POLICE STATION

345
40:47.813 --> 40:49.480
THREE MONTHS LATER

346
41:12.063 --> 41:13.188
What is it, Sergeant?

347
41:17.688 --> 41:20.396
A higher-up invited you to his son's ordination.

348
41:23.396 --> 41:24.313
Want to come with us?

349
41:26.480 --> 41:29.563
Consider it a farewell party before you transfer back to Bangkok.

350
42:16.396 --> 42:17.480
How have you been?

351
42:22.480 --> 42:23.313
I've been well.

352
42:28.021 --> 42:30.271
You're not teaching anymore. What are you going to do?

353
42:33.313 --> 42:35.146
Are you still investigating me?

354
42:42.521 --> 42:43.938
I haven't really thought about it.

355
42:45.480 --> 42:49.771
Just taking my son to and from school will probably take up my whole day.

356
42:51.480 --> 42:53.980
Bangkok traffic is terrible, isn't it?

357
42:56.855 --> 42:58.146
What about you?

358
43:01.146 --> 43:03.688
I'll have to get used to the traffic again too.

359
43:05.396 --> 43:07.813
It's a long drive from my house to the station.

360
43:20.896 --> 43:22.313
Inspector.

361
43:28.980 --> 43:31.230
Thank you so much for saving me.

362
43:33.771 --> 43:34.771
If it weren't for you,

363
43:35.688 --> 43:37.563
I'm not sure how things would've ended.

364
43:41.146 --> 43:42.396
I didn't save you.

365
43:43.646 --> 43:45.271
I was just doing my job.

366
43:55.896 --> 43:58.271
But you can't protect him forever.

367
44:00.396 --> 44:01.730
One day, someone will find out.

368
44:09.271 --> 44:10.230
Find out what?

369
44:12.646 --> 44:14.188
You know what I mean.

370
44:38.105 --> 44:40.480
-Hello. -Hello.

371
44:58.355 --> 45:02.896
That's the agreed price after deducting the outstanding debt, correct?

372
45:40.105 --> 45:40.938
Dad.

373
45:45.438 --> 45:47.896
Aim and I are moving to Bangkok.

374
45:51.396 --> 45:53.563
We probably won't be able to visit very often.

375
45:59.271 --> 46:03.563
Dad, don't give the doctors and nurses a hard time.

376
46:14.188 --> 46:17.563
I'm not angry with you and Mom for what you did.

377
46:29.063 --> 46:31.980
You're no better than the rest of us, Wan.

378
46:48.271 --> 46:49.105
Help me.

379
47:38.105 --> 47:39.021
I'm going now.

380
47:41.605 --> 47:42.855
I'll come back and visit.

381
47:48.438 --> 47:50.438
Take good care of your family.

382
47:51.938 --> 47:54.938
Don't let anyone hurt us again.

383
48:32.355 --> 48:33.563
This is what I got…

384
48:36.146 --> 48:37.730
from selling Uncle Sak's land, Mom.

385
48:58.938 --> 49:01.271
Have you been able to reach Wat?

386
49:12.980 --> 49:14.105
I'm leaving now, Mom.

387
49:17.813 --> 49:20.146
Don't tell anyone what he did.

388
49:22.730 --> 49:24.563
Wat didn't mean it.

389
49:26.605 --> 49:28.230
I think he's sick.

390
49:29.146 --> 49:30.605
If you manage to reach him…

391
49:32.605 --> 49:34.521
tell him to come see me.

392
50:01.521 --> 50:02.521
Mom.

393
50:05.730 --> 50:07.271
Could you love me too?

394
50:15.980 --> 50:17.396
Love me…

395
50:20.355 --> 50:22.105
as much as you love Wat?

396
50:34.271 --> 50:35.646
I'm sorry…

397
50:37.355 --> 50:40.771
for making you think I love Wat more.

398
50:43.230 --> 50:45.563
He needs me more than you do.

399
50:49.021 --> 50:50.021
I know

400
50:51.063 --> 50:52.730
you'll be okay on your own.

401
52:45.563 --> 52:46.646
Mom.

402
52:47.688 --> 52:51.396
We're going to be living so far away.

403
52:51.480 --> 52:54.813
Won't you miss Grandma, Grandpa, and Uncle Wat?

404
52:59.855 --> 53:01.230
I will miss them sometimes.

405
53:04.521 --> 53:05.646
But I have you.

406
53:07.021 --> 53:08.480
That's enough for me.

407
53:13.646 --> 53:17.730
NA SAO VILLAGE NA SAO, CHIANG KHAN, LOEI
